---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'; import '../../styles.css';
---
<Base title="Pricing — VELTRIX" description="VELTRIX pricing and availability.">
  <section class="container page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">Pricing</div><h1>Start simple.<br/>Grow on your terms.</h1><p class="lead">VELTRIX pricing and commercial plans are being prepared. The current project is focused on building a reliable core platform.</p></section>
  <section class="container pricing-grid">
    <article class="price-card"><span class="tag">Current focus</span><h3 style="margin-top:22px">Community</h3><div class="price">Free</div><p>For personal setups and early adopters.</p><ul><li>Core platform access</li><li>Community-driven development</li><li>Public Agent releases</li></ul><a class="button button-dark" href="/download/">Explore releases ↗</a></article>
    <article class="price-card featured"><span class="tag">In development</span><h3 style="margin-top:22px">Pro</h3><div class="price">Coming soon</div><p>For users who need more control and advanced workflows.</p><ul><li>Advanced capabilities</li><li>Expanded operational tools</li><li>Priority support concept</li></ul><a class="button button-light" href="/about/">Project updates ↗</a></article>
    <article class="price-card"><span class="tag">Future</span><h3 style="margin-top:22px">Teams</h3><div class="price">Coming soon</div><p>For collaborative infrastructure management.</p><ul><li>Team workspaces</li><li>Role-based access</li><li>Shared operations</li></ul><a class="button button-light" href="/about/">About VELTRIX ↗</a></article>
  </section>
</Base>
